 :context
 "Ongoing careful, smaller-batch rollout (capable model + mandatory verification per
  agent) after a prior 18-agent haiku batch had a 61% defect rate. 54+ consecutive
  agents on this stricter protocol succeeded before this one. Built from
  cloud-itonami-isic-0124 (growing of pome fruits and stone fruits) as the
  module-structure template, with clojure -M:test independently re-run from fresh
  clones before and after push. Registry entry independently re-verified fresh
  before any work began: {:id \"0125\" :name \"Growing of other tree and bush
  fruits and nuts\" ...} genuinely matches (no ID/name mismatch, a known failure
  mode in this fleet). No prior repository existed at
  cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-0125 or the stale
  gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-A0125 placeholder (404 confirmed)."

 :scope-exclusions
 ["direct field-equipment operation (grower's exclusive authority)"
  "finalizing a spray-application decision (agronomist/grower authority)"
  "harvest-timing / replanting economic decisions (remain human authority)"]

 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-0125 with Governor, Facts, Registry, Store, Advisor,
  Phase, Operation, Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-0124 module-for-module,
  namespace berrynutops.*):
  - Governor (BerryNutOperationsGovernor): 5 hard checks (orchard-not-registered,
    no-execution, field-equipment-or-spray-blocked, op-not-allowed,
    orchard-count-invalid) + 3 escalation gates (always-escalate crop-health
    concern, cost-threshold supply orders, low confidence < 0.7)
  - Facts: supply categories with cost thresholds (seedling/fertilizer/equipment),
    fruit classes (blueberry/raspberry/blackcurrant = bush;
    almond/walnut/hazelnut/pecan = nut)
  - Registry: independent pure predicates (cost-exceeds-threshold?,
    orchard-count-non-positive?, confidence-below-floor?)
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (registered-orchard lookup)
  - Advisor: Advisor protocol + MockAdvisor (4 ops)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate
  - Operation: composes advisor -> governor -> phase-gate (langgraph-clj wiring
    deferred, matching 0124's own stub)
  - Sim: demo runner with a working -main
  - Operations: log-orchard-record, schedule-field-operation,
    flag-crop-health-concern (e.g. spotted wing drosophila/walnut blight, always
    escalates), order-supplies (closed allowlist, :effect :propose)
  - Tests: 31 tests / 105 assertions (facts, governor, phase, registry, store), all
    green -- same shape as 0124's own 31/105 (7 fruit classes with a bush/nut
    :group dimension, 15 governor-test cases with a walnut-blight escalation case
    swapped in for 0124's fire-blight one)
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop), AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - README/business-model/operator-guide describe the real API"

 :consequences
 {:positive
  ["Tree/bush-fruit-and-nut-growing (0125) now genuinely implemented and fully
